B.aao=new A.iq(B.r1,"Watch Videos","Watch Videos","The more time you spend here, the more you'll earn. Users from high-CPM countries can earn up to 3x more per video. Just watch whatever videos, movies, or shorts are available \u2014 every view adds to your balance.\n\nTip: keep the app open and let videos play back-to-back for maximum earnings.","Jitna zyada waqt is per lagayenge, utni zyada earning hogi. High-CPM countries ke users ko per video 3x tak zyada milta hai. Bas jo bhi videos, movies ya shorts available hain unhe dekhte rahen \u2014 har view aapke balance mein add hota hai.\n\nTip: App ko open rakhein aur videos ko lagataar chalne dein taake earning maximum ho.",null,null)
B.aal=new A.iq(B.qQ,"Daily Bonus","Daily Bonus","Log in every single day to claim your Daily Bonus \u2014 it's free extra coins just for showing up. The longer your daily streak, the bigger your reward gets. Don't miss a day, or your streak resets!","Har roz login karke apna Daily Bonus zaroor collect karein \u2014 sirf app kholne par free coins milte hain. Jitni lambi streak hogi, utna zyada reward milega. Ek din bhi miss na karein, warna streak reset ho jayegi!",null,null)
B.M0=new A.b6(57692,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aan=new A.iq(B.M0,"Tasks","Tasks","Complete the tasks listed in this section and get rewarded automatically \u2014 no extra effort needed. Just go about completing them naturally and coins are credited on their own. This is one of the most reliable and consistent ways to earn.","Is section mein diye gaye tasks complete karein aur khud-ba-khud reward payen \u2014 koi extra mehnat nahi. Bas tasks complete karte jayen, coins apne aap credit ho jate hain. Ye ek bohot reliable aur consistent earning source hai.",null,null)
B.aag=new A.iq(B.qR,"Spin Wheel","Spin Wheel","Try your luck on the Spin Wheel and win up to 500 coins in a single spin! Use it daily and those coins add up fast \u2014 many users reach their withdrawal threshold within days just from spinning regularly.","Spin Wheel per apni kismat aazmayein aur ek hi spin mein 500 coins tak jeeten! Ise roz use karein, coins jaldi jama hote hain \u2014 regular spin karne se bohot se users chand dinon mein hi withdrawal ke qabil ho jate hain.",null,null)
B.M8=new A.b6(58092,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aap=new A.iq(B.M8,"Refer a Friend","Refer a Friend","Invite your friends and family to join AdsEarn using your referral link. Earn a bonus for every friend who signs up \u2014 no extra work required on your part. The more people you invite, the more you earn. Inshallah!","Apne dosto aur family ko apne referral link se AdsEarn join karayein. Har naye friend ke sign up karne per aapko bonus milta hai \u2014 iske liye koi extra mehnat nahi karni. Jitne zyada logon ko invite karenge, utna zyada kamayenge. Inshallah!",null,null)
B.aah=new A.iq(B.iU,"Sell Internet","Sell Internet","This feature is available on phone only, and it takes just 2\u20133 easy steps:\n1. Grant the required permission.\n2. Choose whether to sell your mobile data or WiFi connection.\n3. Tap \"Start Selling\" \u2014 that's it!\n\nAfter that, you don't need to do anything else; it works completely in the background. Earnings depend on your country \u2014 users in countries like the US, UK, Canada, Germany, and Australia typically earn the most from bandwidth sharing.",'Ye feature sirf phone par available hai aur sirf 2-3 easy steps mein ho jata hai:\n1. Zaroori permission dein.\n2. Select karein ke aap mobile data bechna chahte hain ya WiFi connection.\n3. "Start Selling" per tap karein \u2014 bas ho gaya!\n\nIske baad aapko kuch bhi nahi karna, ye background mein khud kaam karta rehta hai. Earning aapke country per depend karti hai \u2014 US, UK, Canada, Germany aur Australia jaise countries ke users is se sab se zyada kamate hain.',"Tip: the more devices, new internet connections, and new accounts you use to share bandwidth, the more you can earn overall \u2014 and the faster you'll be able to send your payment request.","Tip: Jitni zyada devices, naye internet connections aur naye accounts se bandwidth share karenge, utna zyada overall earn kar sakte hain \u2014 aur utni jaldi apni payment request bhi bhej sakenge.")
B.aai=new A.iq(B.r2,"Surveys","Surveys","Surveys can pay anywhere from Rs. 100 to Rs. 200 each \u2014 but they're much less common in Pakistan and India. Countries like the US, UK, Canada, and Australia get a much larger number of high-paying surveys, so availability (and earnings) is usually better there.","Har survey se Rs. 100 se Rs. 200 tak mil sakte hain \u2014 lekin Pakistan aur India mein ye kam available hote hain. US, UK, Canada aur Australia jaise countries mein zyada surveys aate hain, is liye wahan availability (aur earning) behtar hoti hai.",null,null)
B.aaf=new A.iq(B.qU,"Typing","Typing","Just answer 150 simple questions and get a great reward for it. It's an easy, quick task that helps you send your payment request much faster.","Bas 150 simple sawalon ke jawab dein aur badle mein acha reward payen. Ye ek asaan aur jaldi hone wala task hai jo aapki payment request ko jaldi bhejne mein madad karta hai.",null,null)
B.aak=new A.iq(B.fR,"Link & Earn","Link & Earn","Add any video link from any platform, then share that link with your friends and ask them to open it, complete all the steps, and watch the video. You'll earn coins for every friend who completes the process \u2014 the more links you share and the more people complete them, the more coins you earn, Inshallah.","Kisi bhi platform ki video ka link add karein, phir wo link apne doston ko bhejein aur unse kahein ke wo link open karke tamam steps complete karne ke baad video dekhein. Har friend ke process complete karne per aapko coins milte hain \u2014 jitne zyada links share karenge aur jitne zyada log unhe complete karenge, utne zyada coins milenge, Inshallah.",null,null)
B.LT=new A.b6(57582,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aaj=new A.iq(B.LT,"Micro Tasks","Micro Tasks","This is our most recommended earning method! Complete micro tasks and earn anywhere from Rs. 20 to Rs. 400. Make sure to use the Offerwall option too for maximum earnings \u2014 inside the Offers tab, complete tasks and PTC (Paid-To-Click) offers, both great earning opportunities. You can also earn through Offerwalls by clicking any available option and completing the games or tasks inside it.","Ye humara sab se best recommended earning method hai! Micro tasks complete karke Rs. 20 se Rs. 400 tak kama sakte hain. Maximum earning ke liye Offerwall option bhi zaroor use karein \u2014 Offers tab ke andar diye gaye tasks aur PTC (Paid-To-Click) offers complete karein, dono bohot acha earning source hain. Offerwalls ke through bhi kama sakte hain, bas kisi bhi available option per click karein aur us ke andar diye gaye games ya tasks complete karein.",null,null)
B.aam=new A.iq(B.qP,"Promote & Earn","Promote & Earn","Promote your videos at very low cost \u2014 add your video link, select the platform it's on, choose whether you want more likes or more followers, then publish. If you'd rather earn instead, select the \"Earn\" option inside this button, where you'll find mini tasks like watching YouTube videos or liking posts. Completing these mini tasks earns you coins.",'Apni videos ko bohot kam cost mein promote karein \u2014 apni video ka link add karein, us platform ko select karein jahan wo hai, aur choose karein ke aapko likes chahiye ya followers, phir publish kar dein. Agar aap earn karna chahte hain to isi button ke andar "Earn" option select karein, jahan aapko mini tasks jaise YouTube video dekhna ya post like karna milenge. Ye mini tasks complete karne per coins milte hain.',null,null)
